        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKohhzZn9W5mZK7Bdf-ji4C2xhx8t75_RiOgFtCWO82IRJt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "About eight years ago, I was looking for a hairdresser, and several recommendations led me to La Mèche Courte salon. With Annie-Claude, I got so much more: a true friend, a highly experienced professional, and an epicurean always seeking new techniques and products who prioritizes and promotes products that are good for both health and the environment. She is the perfect combination of love and rigor.",
        "time": 1732022895,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tania Crevier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102283827601592058391/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXdL8VNnT5LWJwgtJxtLRZcb0nNcJ9fbz0PxTtelHXIlHAs64UM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The best hair salon in town!!!\n\nAnnie-Claude has been doing my hair for several years.\nAlways smiling, professional, a perfectionist, and attentive to her clients.\nIf you want to experience \"THE HAIRDRESSING EXPERIENCE\" in a welcoming environment...you've come to the right place!",
